{
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "description": "Canonical service catalog for Private Link DNS Policy Set. This is the single source of truth. All entries must be reflected in pubsecDNS.parameters.json and, for builtin entries, in the builtInPolicyMap in pubsecDNS.bicep. Run Test-PolicyCoverage.ps1 to validate.",
    "version": "1.3.0",
    "notes": [
        "policyType 'builtin': an Azure built-in policy exists and is referenced in pubsecDNS.bicep builtInPolicyMap.",
        "policyType 'custom': the custom DNS-PE policy template in templates/DNS-PrivateEndpoints is used.",
        "key = resourceNamespace + groupId + filterLocationLike — must be unique across all entries.",
        "filterLocationLike '*' means the zone is global (not region-scoped).",
        "builtInPolicyId must be set for policyType 'builtin', null for 'custom'."
    ],
